        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Francis Ford Coppola, Basil Dean, Mario Puzo, Al Pacino, Robert De Niro, Graham Cutts, Gracie Fields, Richard Dolman, Betty Shale\n- Works: The Godfather Part II, Looking on the Bright Side\n- Roles: film director, producer, screenwriter, film composer, actor, writer, theatrical producer, theatrical director\n\nFacts:\n- Basil Dean was born on 27 September 1888 and died on 22 April 1978.\n- Basil Dean was an English actor, writer, film producer, film director, theatrical producer, and theatrical director.\n- Looking on the Bright Side is a 1932 British musical comedy film.\n- Looking on the Bright Side was directed by Graham Cutts and Basil Dean and starred Gracie Fields, Richard Dolman, and Betty Shale.\n- Francis Ford Coppola was born on April 7, 1939.\n- Francis Ford Coppola is a semi-retired American film director, producer, screenwriter, and film composer, and he has also been credited as Francis Coppola.\n- The Godfather Part II is a 1974 American crime film.\n- The Godfather Part II was produced and directed by Francis Ford Coppola from a screenplay co-written with Mario Puzo, and it starred Al Pacino and Robert De Niro.",
